 {:db/id "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b" :answer-field/id #uuid "6cb5a7c0-71c0-543a-9a51-5b97dd34d5a9" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b/3fbc166f0ca82f98a387364d8e9c36034073c6b33cb86f09819bccc9f55bb35c" "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b/438b4c4d03a21de630e66c77197769846fa4a0ad2f925cfdb3df140268e70810" "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b/cc545c04e2dcad28fd649be5b590cd32108605dca0f2f8781f99422c4ab67505" "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b/747bf59f129b39ed16d0609e880083b7ec7fa22b98988114d7cffd9bba5b175a" "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b/a2a7846129f4ee852a8f2611c0f38d99fcf946b6a537c18beea6a33b457d605c"] :answer-field/correct "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b/438b4c4d03a21de630e66c77197769846fa4a0ad2f925cfdb3df140268e70810" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]}
 {:db/id "q-335438" :question/id #uuid "e15b51c9-b3ac-5fdf-bdd1-db7479e393a2" :question/math-academy-id "q-335438" :question/problem "Consider the following statement. \n\nIf $f(x)=3x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x,$ then $f=O(x)$ as $x\\to 0.$\n\nA proof of the statement is given below.\n\n$\\text{L1}:\\,3x=O(3x)$\n\n$\\text{L2}:\\,{lim}_{x\\to 0}(\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x}{2x})=1$\n\n$\\text{L3}:\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=O(2x)$ as $x\\to 0$\n\n$\\text{L4}:\\,f=O(5x)$ as $x\\to 0$ \n\n$\\text{L5}:\\,f=O(x)$ as $x\\to 0$\n\nSelect the correct options to justify each step of the reasoning.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L1}$ follows from {{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L4}$ follows from lines \n{{field-2}} and \n{{field-3}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L5}$ follows from line {{field-4}}  and \n{{field-5}}." :question/worked-solution "Suppose $f(x),g(x),h(x)$ and $k(x)$ are functions and $c$ is a nonzero constant. Then, we have the following properties of Big-O notation. \n\n- The sum and product properties. If\n\n$$\nf=O(h)\\,\\text{and}\\,g=O(k)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a\n$$\n\nthen\n\n$$\nf+g=O(h+k)\\,\\text{and}\\,fg=O(hk)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a.\n$$\n\n- The constant multiple property. If\n\n$$\nf=O(cg)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a,\n$$\n\nthen\n\n$$\nf=O(g)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a.\n$$\n\n- The reflexive property.\n\n$$\nf=O(f)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a.\n$$\n\n- The transitive property. If\n\n$$\nf=O(g)\\,\\text{and}\\,g=O(h)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a,\n$$\n\nthen\n\n$$\nf=O(h)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a.\n$$\n\n- The absorption property. If\n\n$$\nf=O(g+h)\\,\\text{and}\\,g=O(h)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a,\n$$\n\nthen\n\n$$\nf=O(h)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to a.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let us justify each of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider line $\\text{L1},$ which states that\n\n$$\n3x=O({{3x}_{⏟}}_{f}).\n$$\n\nThis is true by $\\text{the reflexive property}.$\n\n- Next, we consider line $\\text{L4}.$ From line $\\text{L1}$ we have\n\n$$\n3x=O(3x),\n$$\n\nand from line $\\text{L3}$ we have\n\n$$\n-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x=O(2x)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to 0.\n$$\n\nThus, by lines $\\text{L1 and L3}$ and $\\text{the sum property},$ we obtain\n\n$$\nf=O(5x)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to 0.\n$$\n\n- Finally, we consider line $\\text{L5}.$ From line  $\\text{L4}$   we have\n\n$$\nf=O(5x)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to 0,\n$$\n\nand by the $\\text{constant multiple property}$ with $c=5,$ we have\n\n$$\nf=O(x)\\,\\text{as}\\,x\\to 0.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335438/ma-source-field/8b1cea60124f7907edeaaa488e8258e3b70ebf1aca2f1f655e978ff6050fa208" "q-335438/ma-source-field/76272c68fb509289c41a825b269170163ae0303f5b490f466ab948ec68089645" "q-335438/ma-source-field/55fc4dd50013745d82254ce9bfedcf77539178eae9f4cfa8dd23498e47fc11b0" "q-335438/ma-source-field/fa575c164b7854e5e3a6d1a1a27104fdd2d1498072200da369d452c176e32142" "q-335438/ma-source-field/78db145c375158d3d078a7875a7e22c7da014a0aa909fba139ca0bd21907b81b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}
